 svelte-1jsby4n">0552758306</p></span> </div></div></div> <div class="content svelte-1jsby4n">  <div class="truncate-wrapper svelte-10e6dbh"><p data-testid="truncate-text" dir="auto" class="content svelte-10e6dbh" style="--lines: 5; --line-height: var(--lineHeight, 16); --link-length: 4;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Dear sir,I am almost 2 years using Yalla live, last year aI lost my phone number that I paired with my account, And I forgot the password and now i am using WeChat to login to my account. I am VIP member and I charge my account over ( 8000 SAR ) I tried to communicate with VIP AGENTS and VIP customers service in WhatsApp they told me to give them the required to change the old phone number to the new phone number, at the end they told me to remember my password when I told them that I cannot remember, they told me that they cannot help me. After I give them all the bill of my charge in the app and I record from inside the app and I prove that I am using the account, and after I give them a lot of what they require from me they side ( we cannot help you ) I stooped buying coin from the app until you change my phone number.<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></p> </div>  </div></article>  <dialog data-testid="dialog" class="svelte-1a4zf5b" id="" aria-hidden="true"><div data-testid="content-modal" class="content-modal-container svelte-1ih6d3u" dir="auto"><div class="button-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><button data-testid="content-modal-close-button" class="close-button svelte-1ih6d3u" type="button" aria-label="Close"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="content-modal-close-button-svg"><path d="M1.2 18C.6 18 0 17.5 0 16.8c0-.4.1-.6.4-.8l7-7-7-7c-.3-.2-.4-.5-.4-.8C0 .5.6 0 1.2 0c.3 0 .6.1.8.3l7 7 7-7c.2-.2.5-.3.8-.3.6 0 1.2.5 1.2 1.2 0 .3-.1.6-.4.8l-7 7 7 7c.2.2.4.5.4.8 0 .7-.6 1.2-1.2 1.2-.3 0-.6-.1-.8-.3l-7-7-7 7c-.2.1-.5.3-.8.3z"></path></svg></button> </div> <div class="header-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><h1 data-testid="content-modal-ti