that I paired with my account, And I forgot the password and now i am using WeChat to login to my account. I am VIP member and I charge my account over ( 8000 SAR ) I tried to communicate with VIP AGENTS and VIP customers service in WhatsApp they told me to give them the required to change the old phone number to the new phone number, at the end they told me to remember my password when I told them that I cannot remember, they told me that they cannot help me. After I give them all the bill of my charge in the app and I record from inside the app and I prove that I am using the account, and after I give them a lot of what they require from me they side ( we cannot help you ) I stooped buying coin from the app until you change my phone number.<!-- HTML_TAG_END --> </p></article> </div> </div> </dialog> </li><li><article aria-labelledby="review-3543235211-title" class="svelte-1jsby4n"><div class="header svelte-1jsby4n"><div class="title-and-rating-container svelte-1jsby4n"><h3 id="review-3543235211-title" class="title svelte-1jsby4n"> <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1dta22y" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 1);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1dta22y">How</span> </div></h3> <div style="display: contents; --fill-color:var(--systemOrange); --star-size:12px;"><ol class="stars svelte-1fdd9o7" aria-label="1 Star"><li class="star svelte-1fdd9o7"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.86 2.5.565 4.166-.645l14.218-10.455L46.19 59.406c1.666 1.21 3.037 1.505 4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.672-4.166l-5.618-16.718 14.353-10.32c1.666-1.183 2.338-2.42 1.908-3.764-.43-1.29-1.693-1.935-3.763-1.908l-17.605.108-5.348-16.8C34.308 4.496 33.34 3.5 31.944 3.5c-1.372 0-2.34.995-2.984 2.984L23.61 23.283l-17.605-.108c-2.07-.027-3.333.618-3.763 1.908-.457 1.344.242 2.58 1.909 3.763l14.352 10.321-5.617 16.718c-.672 1.962-.43 3.333.672 4.166Z"></path></svg> </li><li class="star svelte-1fdd9o7"><svg class="icon" viewBox="