.26.295c1.103.027 1.802-.43 2.151-1.532l4.677-15.562c.027-.162.08-.215.134-.215.08 0 .135.053.162.215l4.676 15.562c.35 1.102 1.048 1.559 2.15 1.532l16.261-.296c.162 0 .216 0 .243.081.027.08-.027.134-.135.215l-13.385 9.246c-.94.645-1.156 1.478-.78 2.527l5.35 15.374c.026.161.053.188 0 .242-.055.08-.135.026-.243-.054l-12.928-9.864c-.86-.672-1.855-.672-2.715 0l-12.928 9.864c-.107.08-.188.134-.242.054Z"></path></svg> </li> </ol></div></div> <div class="review-header svelte-1jsby4n"><time class="date svelte-1jsby4n" datetime="2018-12-18T03:17:04.000Z">18/12/2018</time>  <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1dta22y" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 1);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1dta22y"><p class="author svelte-1jsby4n">فلاح اليامي</p></span> </div></div></div> <div class="content svelte-1jsby4n">  <div class="truncate-wrapper svelte-10e6dbh"><p data-testid="truncate-text" dir="auto" class="content svelte-10e6dbh" style="--lines: 3; --line-height: var(--lineHeight, 16); --link-length: 4;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->How can i know the facebook account linked with my yalla live account?I don’t know is there any support for this APP because i send request many requests to provide me facebook account linked with my yalla live account &amp; i don’t have option to see it throw APP !!Dear developer,This high importance &amp;urgent please i need to contact with you ?Bad App it doesn’t have support team more than one month there isn’t any body reply to me or close my requestNew note:Why you don’t have authorized to see it you are support &amp; developer If you don’t have that add option to user to see the accounts linked with his App accountMy App account is under my mobile no but there is facebook account linked with it i need to know this facebook account!!!New note:Ido not need to cancel facebook account i asked to provide me the facebook account linked with my yalla account !!!!New note:There isn’t responseUpdate:للامانه.   تطبيق خايس ويفتقر للدعم الفني   لم تحل مشكلتي.   ومع كثر الالحاح مني والمتابعه تم حذف حسابي من قبلكم ودون علمي او طلب منيتطبيق ودعم فني لايستاهل التقييم<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></p> </div>  <div class="developer-response-container svelte-1jsby4n"><span class="developer-response-heading svelte-1jsby4n">Developer Response</span>   <div class="truncate-wrapper svelte-10e6dbh"><p data-testid="truncate-text" dir="auto" class="content svelte-10e6dbh" style="--lines: 1; --line-height: var(--lineHeight, 16); --link-length: 4;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Please send more details about your user ID and screenshot to support@yalla.live, reset your password by mobile number, and we will cancel the link with Facebook account. We hope you enjoy with your friends in Yalla. Warm Regards<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></p> </div> </div></div></article>  <dialog data-testid="dialog" class="svelte-1a4zf5b" id="" aria-hidden="true"><div data-testid="content-modal" class="content-modal-container svelte-1ih6d3u" dir="auto"><div class="button-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><button data-testid="content-modal-close-button" class="close-button svelte-1ih6d3u" type="button" aria-label="Close"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="content-modal-close-button-svg"><path d="M1.2 18C.6 18 0 17.5 0 16.8c0-.4.1-.6.4-.8l7-7-7-7c-.3-.2-.4-.5-.4-.8C0 .5.6 0 1.2 0c.3 0 .6.1.8.3l7 7 7-7c.2-.2.5-.3.8-.3.6 0 1.2.5 1.2 1.2 0 .3-.1.6-.4.8l-7 7 7 7c.2.2.4.5.4.8 0 .7-.6 1.2-1.2 1.2-.3 0-.6-.1-.8-.3l-7-7-7 7c-.2.1-.5.3-.8.3z"></path></svg></button> </div> <div class="header-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><h1 data-testid="content-modal-title" class="title svelte-1ih6d3u">How</h1> </div> <div class="content-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><article aria-labelledby="review-3543235211-title" class="svelte-1jsby4n is-detail-view"><div class="header svelte-1jsby4n"><div class="title-and-rating-container svelte-1jsby4n"> <div style="display: contents; --fill-color:var(--systemOrange); --star-size:24px;"><ol class="stars svel