it you are support &amp; developer If you don’t have that add option to user to see the accounts linked with his App accountMy App account is under my mobile no but there is facebook account linked with it i need to know this facebook account!!!New note:Ido not need to cancel facebook account i asked to provide me the facebook account linked with my yalla account !!!!New note:There isn’t responseUpdate:للامانه.   تطبيق خايس ويفتقر للدعم الفني   لم تحل مشكلتي.   ومع كثر الالحاح مني والمتابعه تم حذف حسابي من قبلكم ودون علمي او طلب منيتطبيق ودعم فني لايستاهل التقييم<!-- HTML_TAG_END --> <div class="developer-response-container svelte-1jsby4n"><div class="developer-response-header svelte-1jsby4n"><span class="developer-response-heading svelte-1jsby4n">Developer Response</span> <time class="date svelte-1jsby4n" datetime="2018-04-18T03:48:12.000Z">18/04/2018</time></div> <!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Please send more details about your user ID and screenshot to support@yalla.live, reset your password by mobile number, and we will cancel the link with Facebook account. We hope you enjoy with your friends in Yalla. Warm Regards<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div></p></article> </div> </div> </dialog> </li><li><article aria-labelledby="review-5098790143-title" class="svelte-1jsby4n"><div class="header svelte-1jsby4n"><div class="title-and-rating-container svelte-1jsby4n"><h3 id="review-5098790143-title" class="title svelte-1jsby4n"> <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1dta22y" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 1);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1dta22y">About Yalla Live application</span> </div></h3> <div style="display: contents; --fill-color:var(--systemOrange); --star-size:12px;"><ol class="stars svelte-1fdd9o7" aria-label="5 Stars"><li class="star svelte-1fdd9o7"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.86 2.5.565 4.166-.645l14.218-10.455L46.19 59.406c1.666 1.21 3.037 1.505 4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.672-4.166l-5.